<div data-cgap-sector="Oil, Gas, Hydrogen &amp; Biogas" data-cgap-term="oil and gas"></div><p class="lead">Lease sites and energy facilities need signs that name the exact hazard at the exact spot: vapors at the tank gauge hatch, a pumping unit that can start without warning, a separator and heater treater, or a hydrogen tube trailer pad.</p><p>These signs cover production well pads, wellheads, tank batteries, manual gauging stations, separators, pumping units, well site generators and hydrogen storage. They are 8x12 aluminum for fences, tank ladders and skid frames in the weather.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Production separator and heater treater</h3><p>19 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the tailpipe support at the walkway.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pressure-relief-valve-tailpipe-sign-cgap-c10010-812">Pressure Relief Valve Tailpipe</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-heater-treater-firetube-housing-sign-cgap-c06780-812">Heater Treater Firetube Housing</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-heater-treater-stack-sign-cgap-c07115-812">Heater Treater Stack</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-line-heater-bath-shell-sign-cgap-c07250-812">Line Heater Bath Shell</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Production well pad</h3><p>16 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the lease gate post facing arriving vehicles and pedestrians.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-well-pad-entrance-sign-cgap-c01055-812">Well Pad Entrance</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-lease-road-washout-sign-cgap-c01190-812">Lease Road Washout</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-cattle-guard-approach-sign-cgap-c01325-812">Cattle Guard Approach</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-lease-gate-sign-cgap-c01460-812">Lease Gate</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Production tank battery</h3><p>16 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: At the bottom step of the tank stairway.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-tank-battery-stairs-sign-cgap-c10145-812">Tank Battery Stairs</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-tank-stair-landing-sign-cgap-c10280-812">Tank Stair Landing</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-tank-roof-walkway-sign-cgap-c10415-812">Tank Roof Walkway</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-tank-walkway-handrail-sign-cgap-c10550-812">Tank Walkway Handrail</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Well site controls and power</h3><p>14 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the RTU cabinet door near the hinge.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-rtu-control-cabinet-sign-cgap-c12705-812">RTU Control Cabinet</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-rtu-cabinet-doorstop-sign-cgap-c13040-812">RTU Cabinet Doorstop</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-solar-panel-array-sign-cgap-c13175-812">Solar Panel Array</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-solar-panel-stand-sign-cgap-c13310-812">Solar Panel Stand</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Hydrogen tube trailer and storage pad</h3><p>12 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: At the walk-in point of the tube trailer pad.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-tube-trailer-pad-sign-cgap-c15185-812">Hydrogen Tube Trailer Pad</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-tube-trailer-landing-gear-sign-cgap-c15319-812">Hydrogen Tube Trailer Landing Gear</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-tube-trailer-wheel-chocks-sign-cgap-c15453-812">Hydrogen Tube Trailer Wheel Chocks</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-tube-trailer-bay-sign-cgap-c15587-812">Hydrogen Tube Trailer Bay</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pumping unit</h3><p>12 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the pumping unit prime mover housing, near the engine access panel.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pumping-unit-engine-sign-cgap-c03615-812">Pumping Unit Engine</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-pumping-unit-belt-guard-sign-cgap-i03750-812">Pumping Unit Belt Guard</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pumping-unit-electric-motor-sign-cgap-c03750-812">Pumping Unit Electric Motor</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pumping-unit-muffler-sign-cgap-c04085-812">Pumping Unit Muffler</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Stationary hydrogen storage vessel</h3><p>10 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: At the walking route next to vessel saddles.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-storage-vessel-base-sign-cgap-c17185-812">Hydrogen Storage Vessel Base</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-vessel-access-stairs-sign-cgap-c17318-812">Hydrogen Vessel Access Stairs</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-vessel-stair-landing-sign-cgap-c17451-812">Hydrogen Vessel Stair Landing</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-vessel-valve-skid-sign-cgap-c17584-812">Hydrogen Vessel Valve Skid</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Hydrogen cylinder rack and bundle storage</h3><p>10 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: At the cylinder rack entry.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-cylinder-rack-sign-cgap-c18703-812">Hydrogen Cylinder Rack</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-cylinder-chain-sign-cgap-c19030-812">Hydrogen Cylinder Chain</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-cylinder-cart-sign-cgap-c19156-812">Hydrogen Cylinder Cart</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hydrogen-cylinder-valve-cap-sign-cgap-c19281-812">Hydrogen Cylinder Valve Cap</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>Do you have hydrogen storage signs?</summary><p>Yes, for tube trailers, stationary vessels and cylinder bundles. Search &quot;hydrogen&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>Will these signs fade in the sun?</summary><p>They use UV-stable print on aluminum, built for outdoor lease and plant sites.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for tank gauging?</summary><p>Yes, including gauge hatch and manual gauging station signs. Search &quot;gauge hatch&quot;.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have hydrogen storage signs?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, for tube trailers, stationary vessels and cylinder bundles. Search \"hydrogen\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Will these signs fade in the sun?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "They use UV-stable print on aluminum, built for outdoor lease and plant sites."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for tank gauging?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including gauge hatch and manual gauging station signs. Search \"gauge hatch\"."}}]}</script>